<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT TO SHADE LOWER.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT TO SHADE LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were a</p>
<p>shade lower or flat at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Monday. The three-month rate was flat at 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>			   April 7 fix	   April 4 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	    3.01 pct		3.02 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	    3.04 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	    3.08 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	    3.23 pct		3.23 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	    3.39 pct		3.40 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	   3.55 pct		3.56 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
